# Project status

This page records the intentional current state of a pristine generated `{{ service_name }}` service.

## Ready foundation

The generated repository provides the FastAPI composition root, typed configuration, request context, safe error mapping, Logfire instrumentation foundations, mandatory PostgreSQL session and transaction ownership, Alembic integration, Docker packaging, Helm resources, and the locked local quality workflow.

The two base endpoints are ready:

- `GET /` returns the service root envelope;
- `GET /openapi.get` publishes the wrapped FastAPI OpenAPI document.

Their exact contract is listed in the [public surface manifest](../api/public-surface.md).

## Intentionally absent

Business functionality is absent by design. The pristine repository defines no concrete business operation, entity, table, migration, remote-service client, authentication policy, or authorization policy.

[`SERVICE.md`](../../SERVICE.md) must define the concrete service purpose, responsibilities, and service-specific rules before those capabilities are added. Future domain documentation should describe only responsibilities established there and must be linked from the documentation home when it is introduced.

See the [architecture overview](../architecture/overview.md) for layer ownership and [contributing](../development/contributing.md) for change discipline.
